        "review": "The game is very polished. However there are two main issues.\n\nTook me about half the game to realize that I could never make crazy builds. Like all fire mages, or a full stack of warriors.  The game bills itself as a Formation management game. But even with a skill tree everything is linear and the only choice you can make is to put your wizard in front of, or behind your fighters. (you guess which is better)\n\nAlso its grindy for no real gain. It doesnt feel like im progressing.\n\nThe art and the play are great, but for some reason no one told them it wasnt fun in its current balance.",
